{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942820/extras/bb0a3cfaa6802e2a1f31eee0827e686b.apng?t=1762575268\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942820/extras/bb0a3cfaa6802e2a1f31eee0827e686b.poster.avif?t=1762575268\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NECROMENTAL</strong> is a <strong>retro-inspired incremental RPG</strong> about overscaling <strong>necromancy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942820/extras/24247a82b1fc35a44b2236d92a2b1ff4.avif?t=1762575268\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play the role of a lonesome <strong>Necromancer</strong> with the power to assimilate any unit you (or your minions) defeat, immediately turning their allegiance while retaining all of their <strong>special abilities and stats</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942820/extras/95eb0ca9998a8ca69de55bc8f53b2d48.avif?t=1762575268\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your undead army is constantly growing in both number and power, unlocking <strong>bizarrely overpowered combinations</strong> as you progress, yet finding great challenges to put your forces to the test along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942820/extras/19edd2321ac068ea5a0a64841fc35303.avif?t=1762575268\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battling through damp <strong>dungeons</strong>, meeting <strong>unsettling characters</strong>, fulfilling <strong>organic questlines</strong>, looting <strong>magical trinkets</strong> and defeating <strong>humongous bosses</strong> are just a few examples of what it means to face the world of NECROMENTAL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud835\udd23\ud835\udd1e\ud835\udd26\ud835\udd29 \ud835\udd31\ud835\udd2c \ud835\udd20\ud835\udd2c\ud835\udd2b\ud835\udd31\ud835\udd2f\ud835\udd2c\ud835\udd29 \ud835\udd31\ud835\udd25\ud835\udd22 \ud835\udd07\ud835\udd22\ud835\udd1e\ud835\udd21, \ud835\udd1e\ud835\udd2b\ud835\udd21 \ud835\udd31\ud835\udd25\ud835\udd2c\ud835\udd32 \ud835\udd30\ud835\udd25\ud835\udd1e\ud835\udd29\ud835\udd29 \ud835\udd27\ud835\udd2c\ud835\udd26\ud835\udd2b \ud835\udd31\ud835\udd25\ud835\udd22\ud835\udd2a.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80\ud83d\udc80</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942820?t=1762575268","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942820/35206fcd376b3bf51067a14ca31b73442f61fec0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762575268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942820/b146c70a0b992445ea395c5ac00f1b1c81909449/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762575268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942820/b146c70a0b992445ea395c5ac00f1b1c81909449/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762575268","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Te